## 8. Simplify and Correct the Product Categories

The business deals with these four parent meat categories only:

- Chicken (مرغ)
- Lamb (گوسفندی)
- Beef (گوساله)
- Turkey (بوقلمون)

Remove the standalone business category called "گوشت" if it represents a separate inventory category rather than a generic label.

